# handle-shift (M9): a handle dragged with Shift locking it to one axis (CartesianPlane.test.tsx:
# "drags a handle freely, Shift locking it to the axis it moved along most (FV 11)"). On x² the
# stretch grip ■ sits at (1, 1), (1006, 438) at 1440 x 900; pressed, Shift held, moved 50 right and
# 10 down over 160 ms: since the press it has moved 1 along x and 0.2 along y, so only x follows and
# it lands at (2, 1) (D21: the grip sets a and b: b 0.5, a 1, the curve (0.5x)²). Shift let go and
# moved a px more, it follows both ways: (2, 0.78), a 0.78.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 1006 438
wait 500
down
hold Shift
move 1056 448 over 160
wait 16
shot locked
release Shift
move 1056 449
wait 16
shot free
up
wait 500
shot released
